<title>ITALY: Two Fiat units suspended in Milan.</title>
<headline>Two Fiat units suspended in Milan.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian stock market regulator said it had suspended Fiat units Comau Finanziaria and Berto Lamet from trading for Thursday ahead of a statement.</p>
<p>Comau is a robotics and automation company and controls Berto Lamet which makes vehicle parts.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
